docs {
  # Resume Status

  Answers `{ updatedAt }` when a resume is stored and **404**
  `RESUME_NOT_CONFIGURED` when none is. Nothing about Cloudinary leaves the API
  here — the public id and version stay internal.

  The website calls this before rendering the download link, because that link
  is a plain anchor: without the check a visitor would open a new tab and see
  the raw error envelope of **Download Resume**.

  | Status | Meaning |
  | --- | --- |
  | 200 | `{ updatedAt }` |
  | 404 | `RESUME_NOT_CONFIGURED` — see **Upload Resume** |
}
